@prefix dbo:	<http://dbpedia.org/ontology/> .
@prefix dbr:	<http://dbpedia.org/resource/> .
@prefix rdf:	<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Three different films, one outcome each (matches deck slide m5-19).

# Conforms: one @en + one @de, both within 100–2000, unique per language.
dbr:North_by_Northwest rdf:type dbo:Work ;
	dbo:abstract "North by Northwest is a 1959 American spy thriller film produced and directed by Alfred Hitchcock, starring Cary Grant."@en ,
		"Der unsichtbare Dritte (Originaltitel North by Northwest) ist ein US-amerikanischer Thriller, der 1959 von Alfred Hitchcock nach einem Drehbuch von Ernest Lehman gedreht wurde."@de .

# Violates: two @en (not unique per language) and the first is under 100 chars (minLength).
dbr:Psycho rdf:type dbo:Work ;
	dbo:abstract "Psycho is a 1960 American horror film directed by Alfred Hitchcock."@en ,
		"Psycho follows a Phoenix secretary who steals money from her employer and hides at a remote motel run by a troubled young man and his domineering mother."@en .

# Violates: French abstract — @fr is not in the allowed language list (en, de).
dbr:Vertigo rdf:type dbo:Work ;
	dbo:abstract "Sueurs froides (Vertigo) est un film américain réalisé par Alfred Hitchcock, sorti en 1958."@fr .
